+### 4.3 list_conversations
+
+Requests the summaries belonging to the authenticated connection's user. A client-supplied user id does not select whose conversations are listed; the server takes identity from the connection. The response serializes summary timestamps as ISO strings ([validated by: answers a list request with only the authenticated user’s summaries as ISO dates](../../src/transport/ws/conversationList.acceptance.test.ts#L17)).
+
